fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266SliceHdr","fragment":"\n\tGstH266SliceHdr\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266SliceHdr\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266SliceHdr\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 slice header.\nthe picture header of GstH266PicHdr.\nspecifies the subpicture ID of the subpicture.\nspecifies the slice address of the slice.\ncould have any value.\nspecifies the number of tiles in the slice.\nspecifies the coding type of the slice.\naffects the output of previously-decoded\npictures in the DPB.\nspecifies whether ALF is enabled for the Y, Cb, or Cr\ncolour component of the current slice.\nspecifies the number of ALF APSs.\nspecifies the aps_adaptation_parameter_set_id of the i-th\nALF APS that the luma component of the slice refers to.\nspecifies whether ALF is enabled for the Cb colour\ncomponent of the current slice.\nspecifies whether ALF is enabled for the Cr colour\ncomponent of the current slice.\nspecifies the aps_adaptation_parameter_set_id of the ALF\nAPS that the chroma component of the slice refers to.\nspecifies whether CCALF is enabled for the Cb\ncolour component.\nspecifies the aps_adaptation_parameter_set_id that the Cb\ncolour component of the slice refers to.\nspecifies whether CCALF is enabled for the Cr\ncolour component of the current slice.\nspecifies the aps_adaptation_parameter_set_id that the Cr\ncolour component of the slice refers to.\nspecifies that luma mapping is used for the current slice\nand chroma scaling could be used for the current slice.\nspecifies that the explicit scaling list\nis used in the scaling process for transform coefficients.\nreference pictures lists of GstH266RefPicLists.\nspecifies whether the syntax element\nsh_num_ref_idx_active_minus1[0] is present for P and B slices.\nis used for the derivation of the variable\nNumRefIdxActive[i].\nthe calculated NumRefIdxActive value.\nspecifies the method for determining the initialization\ntable used in the initialization process for context variables.\nspecifies whether the collocated picture used for\ntemporal motion vector prediction is derived from RPL 0.\nspecifies the reference index of the collocated picture\nused for temporal motion vector prediction.\nprediction weight table of GstH266PredWeightTable.\nspecifies the initial value of QpY to be used for the coding\nblocks in the slice.\nspecifies a difference to be added to the value of\npps_cb_qp_offset when determining the value of the Qp'Cb quantization.\nspecifies a difference to be added to the value of\npps_cr_qp_offset when determining the value of the Qp' Cr quantization.\nspecifies a difference to be added to the value of\npps_joint_cbcr_qp_offset_value when determining the value of the Qp'CbCr.\nspecifies whether the\ncu_chroma_qp_offset_flag could be present in the transform unit and palette\ncoding syntax of the current slice.\nspecifies whether SAO is used for the luma component\nin the current slice.\nspecifies whether SAO is used for the chroma component\nin the current slice.\nspecifies whether the deblocking parameters\ncould be present in the slice header.\nspecifies whether the deblocking filter is\ndisabled for the current slice.\nspecify the deblocking parameter offsets for beta that\nare applied to the luma component for the current slice.\nspecify the deblocking parameter offsets for tC that\nare applied to the luma component for the current slice.\nspecify the deblocking parameter offsets for beta that\nare applied to the Cb component for the current slice.\nspecify the deblocking parameter offsets for tC that\nare applied to the Cb component for the current slice.\nspecify the deblocking parameter offsets for beta that\nare applied to the Cr component for the current slice.\nspecify the deblocking parameter offsets for tC that\nare applied to the Cr component for the current slice.\nspecifies whether dependent quantization is used.\nspecifies whether sign bit hiding is not used\nfor the current slice.\nspecifies whether the residual_coding\nsyntax structure is used to parse the residual samples of a transform skip\nblock for the current slice.\nspecifies whether Rice parameter used\nfor the residual_ts_coding syntax structure in the current slice.\nspecifies whether the coordinates of the last\nsignificant coefficient are coded relative to ( 0, 0 ) for each transform\nblock of the current slice.\nspecifies the length of the slice header\nextension data in bytes.\ncould have any value.\nNumEntryPoints specifies the number of entry points in\nthe current slice.\nspecifies the length, in bits, of the\nsh_entry_point_offset_minus1[i] syntax elements.\nspecifies the i-th entry point offset in bytes.\nsize of the slice_header in bits.\nnumber of emulation prevention bytes (EPB) in\nthis slice_header.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 slice header.\nthe picture header of GstCodecParsers.H266PicHdr.\nspecifies the subpicture ID of the subpicture.\nspecifies the slice address of the slice.\ncould have any value.\nspecifies the number of tiles in the slice.\nspecifies the coding type of the slice.\naffects the output of previously-decoded\npictures in the DPB.\nspecifies whether ALF is enabled for the Y, Cb, or Cr\ncolour component of the current slice.\nspecifies the number of ALF APSs.\nspecifies the aps_adaptation_parameter_set_id of the i-th\nALF APS that the luma component of the slice refers to.\nspecifies whether ALF is enabled for the Cb colour\ncomponent of the current slice.\nspecifies whether ALF is enabled for the Cr colour\ncomponent of the current slice.\nspecifies the aps_adaptation_parameter_set_id of the ALF\nAPS that the chroma component of the slice refers to.\nspecifies whether CCALF is enabled for the Cb\ncolour component.\nspecifies the aps_adaptation_parameter_set_id that the Cb\ncolour component of the slice refers to.\nspecifies whether CCALF is enabled for the Cr\ncolour component of the current slice.\nspecifies the 